  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Institute for Industrial Environmental Economics (IIIEE) of Lund University is hosting a programme called the Young Masters Programme that is implemented globally. The overall  objectives of the programme are &quot;to improve understanding of the sustainability challenges we are facing: to provide the tools to turn these challenges into possibilities; and to bring individual empowerm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida finansierar utvecklingsfasen f&#xF6;r distansutbildning inom h&#xE5;llbar utveckling vid International Institute for Industrial Enviromental Economics (IIIEE), Lund universitet - the Young Masters Programme on Sustainable Development (YMP). YMP avser utveckla en plattform som kan bidra med gratis n&#xE4;tbaserad distansutbildning till upp till 30 000 studenter i &#xE5;ldersgruppen 16 till 18 &#xE5;r.</narrative>
  </description>
